      "url": "https://www.manualslib.com/manual/2040014/Ge-Epm-5100.html?page=71",
      "note": "chapter 5: Modbus memory map (table 5-2) and format codes (table 5-3); GE's manual, read from the ManualsLib copy"
    }
  ],
  "notes": [
    "The manual numbers registers R00000 to R00003 (command coils), R31000 to R31118 (dynamic values, read only), R40000 to R40009 (fixed values) and R43000 to R43029 (setpoints). The first digit is the area and the other four the address as sent: R31000 is input register 1000.",
    "Values marked F in the manual are 32-bit floats and those marked L 32-bit integers, each in two registers. The manual does not give the word order; high word first is assumed.",
    "Setpoints can only be changed from the faceplate, except the clock.",
    "Written from the manufacturer's manual; not tested on a device."
  ],
  "byte_order": "big",
  "word_order": "big",
